      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree that this is really needed.\n\nThe conversion factor of \\V 1 is $0.083325. Having the real amount displayed in the wallet, but also when buying subscriptions and other places would make this much more transparent and more likely for people to spend money.",
